      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 11:25 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2011-10-9647",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "1d17a9f8eeea4bffeaf349d9d4ba207d75a06b4a5de88baa118f1ebcad6c5099",
